# for multica login
MULTICA_SERVER_URL=https://multica.ai
MULTICA_TOKEN=YOU_TOKEN

# runtime container name(for restart)
CONTAINER_NAME=YOU_CONTAINER_NAME_FOR_RUNTIME

# host docker group gid (so the container's ubuntu user can access /var/run/docker.sock)
# get it on the host with: stat -c %g /var/run/docker.sock
DOCKER_HOST_GID=999

# API tokens for opencode providers
DEEPSEEK_TOKEN=YOU_DEEPSEEK_TOKEN
OPENCODE_GO_TOKEN=YOU_OPENCODE_GO_TOKEN

# NewAPI gateway (used by dsh via the dsh-llm-newapi plugin, and codex via CLIProxyAPI)
NEW_API_TOKEN=YOU_NEW_API_TOKEN
NEW_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.8.228:3000

# OmniRoute gateway (used by codex as default provider, and added to opencode)
OMNIROUTE_TOKEN=YOU_OMNIROUTE_TOKEN
OMNIROUTE_BASE_URL=http://192.168.8.228:20128

# --- Codex CLI (default: OmniRoute, fallback: official DeepSeek) ---
# OMNIROUTE_TOKEN is used first: Codex connects to the OmniRoute gateway
# (~/.codex/config.toml + models.json, wire_api = "responses").
# OmniRoute serves two DeepSeek models: sol maps to deepseek-v4-pro,
# luna maps to deepseek-v4-flash. Default model is luna (deepseek-v4-flash).
# If OMNIROUTE_TOKEN is not set, Codex falls back to the official DeepSeek
# integration using DEEPSEEK_TOKEN directly.
# No bridge needed — official integration uses Codex native provider config.

# --- CLIProxyAPI bridge (Codex 协议转换) ---
# Codex CLI 只会说 OpenAI 的 responses 协议；若上游网关（如 new-api）只提供
# /v1/chat/completions，直连会失败。容器启动时会拉起 CLIProxyAPI 监听
# 127.0.0.1:8317，把 Codex 的 responses 请求翻译成 chat/completions 再转发上游。
# 参考 https://help.router-for.me/introduction/quick-start.html
#
# CLIPROXY_BRIDGE: auto(默认) / on / off
#   auto —— 探测上游 POST /v1/responses：返回 404/405/501（明确不支持）时启用桥接；
#           返回 200 则保持直连；上游为 newapi 时 401/403 也启用桥接（new-api 鉴权
#           早于路由匹配，常被 401 拦下）；其它情况（网络不通等）保持既有直连行为。
#   on   —— 无条件启用；off —— 禁用桥接。
# CLIPROXY_BRIDGE=auto
# CLIPROXY_PORT=8317
# CLIPROXY_HOME=/home/ubuntu/.cli-proxy-api
# 桥接自身的访问 key（不给定时自动生成并持久化在 $CLIPROXY_HOME/api_key）
# CLIPROXY_API_KEY=sk-...
# 转发给上游的模型映射，格式 "上游模型名:Codex侧名字"，逗号分隔；别名省略时两边同名。
# 默认沿用 Codex 直连该上游时的模型集（new-api: deepseek-v4-flash,deepseek-v4-pro,qwen3.8-flash；
# deepseek 官方: deepseek-v4-flash,deepseek-v4-pro）
# CLIPROXY_MODELS="deepseek-chat:deepseek-v4-flash,deepseek-reasoner:deepseek-v4-pro"

# --- CodeBuddy CLI ---
# CodeBuddy models.json is auto-generated with four models:
#   - deepseek-v4-pro (DeepSeek API)
#   - deepseek-v4-flash (DeepSeek API)
#   - deepseek-v4-flash-omniroute (OmniRoute gateway)
#   - opencode-go (OpenCode Go API)
# Uses DEEPSEEK_TOKEN, OMNIROUTE_TOKEN and OPENCODE_GO_TOKEN from above.

# --- dsh (DeepSeek Harness) CLI ---
# dsh connects DeepSeek official API via DEEPSEEK_TOKEN (mapped to
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY). NewAPI 网关由 dsh-llm-newapi 插件管理：NEW_API_TOKEN
# 自动写入 $DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml 的 refs.newapi；端点与模型列表写入
# $DSH_HOME/settings.yaml 的 llm-newapi 段（NEW_API_BASE_URL，默认
# http://192.168.8.228:3000，自动补 /v1）—— headless 容器无需打开 Web UI。
# Multica runtime profile 与插件已预装（dsh plugin --profile multica add
# dsh-profile-multica + dsh-llm-newapi）；daemon 在
# `dsh --profile multica --probe` 成功后注册 DeepSeek Harness。
#
# 版本锁定：dsh（DSH_VERSION）与 dsh-llm-newapi（DSH_LLM_NEWAPI_VERSION）是
# 硬兼容配对，两个版本必须一起升级。插件 npm latest（0.8.4）只为旧 dsh seam
# 构建，在新 dsh 上会因 deepEqualJson 迁移而加载失败，导致 --probe 报错。
# 当前配对：dsh 0.1.5-rc.1 + dsh-llm-newapi 0.8.6-rc.1（npm next）。
# 升级 dsh 前先看插件仓库的 "Version compatibility"。
#
# 另：构建期用 scripts/patch-dsh-env.mjs 给 dsh 打一处幂等 patch —— dsh 的
# 子进程环境清洗会删掉名字含 TOKEN/KEY/SECRET 的变量，MULTICA_TOKEN 因此
# 在 dsh 的 bash 工具里消失，multica CLI 报 “agent execution context
# requires MULTICA_TOKEN to be a task-scoped mat_ token”。patch 放行它。

# --- Reasonix CLI ---
# Reasonix connects to BOTH the DeepSeek official API and the OmniRoute gateway.
# On container start, entrypoint writes ~/.reasonix/.env (DEEPSEEK_API_KEY,
# OMNIROUTE_API_KEY) and ~/.reasonix/config.toml with two providers:
#   - deepseek (official DeepSeek, models deepseek-v4-flash / deepseek-v4-pro)
#   - omniroute (OmniRoute gateway, models deepseek-v4-flash / deepseek-v4-pro)
# Switch provider with `reasonix run --model deepseek "<task>"` or
# `reasonix run --model omniroute "<task>"`.
# In a project dir, just run `reasonix` (or `reasonix run "<task>"`) to start.

# Optional: Reasonix default model override (defaults to deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash)
# REASONIX_DEFAULT_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash